{"text":{"en":{"오일씰 NOK 호환표 | [회사명] 베어링":"Oil Seal NOK Compatibility Table | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal NOK Compatibility Table</p> <h2>오일씰 NOK 호환표</h2> <p>당사 오일씰 형번과 NOK 호환 형번(SC/SB/TC/TB/VC/VB 재질·형상별)을 정리한 표입니다. 형번 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK·삼정·대광 3사 규격 모두 겹침 · ★ = NOK·삼정 겹침 · △ = 삼정·대광 겹침 · ⬠ = NOK·대광 겹침</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal NOK Compatibility Table</p> <h2>Oil Seal NOK Compatibility Table</h2> <p>This table lists our oil seal model numbers alongside NOK-compatible model numbers (by SC/SB/TC/TB/VC/VB material/shape). Searching with just part of a model number also works.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = Overlaps across all 3 makers' specs (NOK · Samjung · Daekwang) · ★ = Overlaps between NOK · Samjung · △ = Overlaps between Samjung · Daekwang · ⬠ = Overlaps between NOK · Daekwang</p>","<label for=\"nokFilter\">형번 검색</label> <input id=\"nokFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: R/T8-18 또는 AC 0052\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"nokFilter\">Search by Model Number</label> <input id=\"nokFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. R/T8-18 or AC 0052\" autocomplete=\"off\">","품명":"Product Name","※ 위 표는 당사 정식 호환표 원본을 기준으로 작성했습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 당사 정식 규격표 원본으로 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"* The table above was prepared based on our official compatibility table original. Before precision machining or ordering, please be sure to make a final confirmation with our official specification sheet original.","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal NOK Compatibility Table</p> <h2>오일씰 NOK 호환표</h2> <p>당사 오일씰 형번과 NOK 호환 형번(SC/SB/TC/TB/VC/VB 재질·형상별)을 정리한 표입니다. 형번 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK·삼정·대광 3사 규격 모두 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ★ = NOK·삼정 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; △ = 삼정·대광 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ⬠ = NOK·대광 겹침</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal NOK Compatibility Table</p> <h2>Oil Seal NOK Cross-Reference Table</h2> <p>A table matching our oil seal model numbers with compatible NOK model numbers (by SC/SB/TC/TB/VC/VB material and shape). You can search by entering just part of a model number.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = size shared by all three: NOK, Samjung and Daekwang &nbsp;·&nbsp; ★ = shared by NOK and Samjung &nbsp;·&nbsp; △ = shared by Samjung and Daekwang &nbsp;·&nbsp; ⬠ = shared by NOK and Daekwang</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">형태 참고용 개념도 (SWS 카탈로그 실측 도면·NOK 등 제조사 도면 아님) — 일반적인 오일씰(스프링·더스트 립 있는 형식) 단면</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 240\" width=\"340\" height=\"227\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"88\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"152\"> </g> <line x1=\"128\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"> <text x=\"236\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">축</text> <g> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"> </g> <g transform=\"translate(0,240) scale(1,-1)\"> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"> </g> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"40\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"200\"> <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"200\" marker-start=\"url(#nokArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#nokArrow)\"> <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"152\" marker-start=\"url(#nokArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#nokArrow)\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"18\"> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"18\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"24\" marker-start=\"url(#nokArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#nokArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"108\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D</text> <text x=\"182\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <text x=\"175\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">H</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"196\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"40\"> <line x1=\"194\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"70\"> <line x1=\"182\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"100\"> <line x1=\"153\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"214\"> </g> <text x=\"262\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">금속 케이스</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">스프링</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">주 립</text> <text x=\"140\" y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">더스트 립</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">오른쪽: 오일 측</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">왼쪽: 외부(먼지) 측</text> <defs> <marker id=\"nokArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경 = 축 지름) · D(외경 = 하우징 구멍 지름) · H(두께) — 표의 d·D·H 열이 이 위치입니다. TYPE에 따라 더스트 립·스프링 유무, 금속 케이스의 고무 피복 여부가 달라지며(예: 더스트 립이 없는 형식도 있음), 개념도 비례는 실제와 다를 수 있습니다.</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Conceptual diagram for shape reference only (not an SWS catalog measured drawing or a drawing from NOK or other manufacturers) — cross-section of a typical oil seal (type with spring and dust lip)</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 240\" width=\"340\" height=\"227\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"88\"/> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"152\"/> </g> <line x1=\"128\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"/> <text x=\"236\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">Shaft</text> <g> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/> </g> <g transform=\"translate(0,240) scale(1,-1)\"> <path d=\"M150,40 H200 V58 H188 L180,88 L172,86 L170,66 H162 L154,86 L150,84 Z\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/> <path d=\"M156,45 H196 V51 H162 V62 H156 Z\" fill=\"#999999\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/> <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"73\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/> </g> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"40\"/> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"200\"/> <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"200\" marker-start=\"url(#nokArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#nokArrow)\"/> <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"152\" marker-start=\"url(#nokArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#nokArrow)\"/> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"18\"/> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"18\"/> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"24\" marker-start=\"url(#nokArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#nokArrow)\"/> </g> <text x=\"108\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D</text> <text x=\"182\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <text x=\"175\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">H</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"196\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"40\"/> <line x1=\"194\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"70\"/> <line x1=\"182\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"100\"/> <line x1=\"153\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"214\"/> </g> <text x=\"262\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Metal case</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Spring</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Main lip</text> <text x=\"140\" y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Dust lip</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">Right: oil side</text> <text x=\"262\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">Left: outside (dust) side</text> <defs> <marker id=\"nokArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"/> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d (bore = shaft diameter) · D (outer diameter = housing bore diameter) · H (thickness) — these are the d, D and H columns in the table. Depending on the TYPE, the presence of a dust lip or spring and whether the metal case is rubber-covered differ (e.g. some types have no dust lip), and the diagram’s proportions may differ from the actual product.</p>","형번 검색":"Search by Model Number"},"ja":{"오일씰 NOK 호환표 | [회사명] 베어링":"オイルシールNOK互換表 | [会社名]ベアリング","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal NOK Compatibility Table</p> <h2>오일씰 NOK 호환표</h2> <p>당사 오일씰 형번과 NOK 호환 형번(SC/SB/TC/TB/VC/VB 재질·형상별)을 정리한 표입니다. 형번 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK·삼정·대광 3사 규격 모두 겹침 · ★ = NOK·삼정 겹침 · △ = 삼정·대광 겹침 · ⬠ = NOK·대광 겹침</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal NOK Compatibility Table</p> <h2>オイルシールNOK互換表</h2> <p>当社オイルシール形番とNOK互換形番(SC/SB/TC/TB/VC/VB材質・形状別)をまとめた表です。形番の一部だけ入力しても検索できます。</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK・三正・大光3社規格すべて重複 · ★ = NOK・三正重複 · △ = 三正・大光重複 · ⬠ = NOK・大光重複</p>","<label for=\"nokFilter\">형번 검색</label> <input id=\"nokFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: R/T8-18 또는 AC 0052\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"nokFilter\">形番検索</label> <input id=\"nokFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: R/T8-18 または AC 0052\" autocomplete=\"off\">","품명":"品名","※ 위 표는 당사 정식 호환표 원본을 기준으로 작성했습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 당사 정식 규격표 원본으로 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"※上記の表は当社正式互換表原本を基準に作成しました。精密加工・発注前には必ず当社正式規格表原本で最終確認をお願いいたします。","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal NOK Compatibility Table</p> <h2>오일씰 NOK 호환표</h2> <p>당사 오일씰 형번과 NOK 호환 형번(SC/SB/TC/TB/VC/VB 재질·형상별)을 정리한 표입니다. 형번 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK·삼정·대광 3사 규격 모두 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ★ = NOK·삼정 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; △ = 삼정·대광 겹침 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ⬠ = NOK·대광 겹침</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Oil Seal NOK Compatibility Table</p> <h2>オイルシールNOK互換表</h2> <p>当社オイルシール形番とNOK互換形番(SC/SB/TC/TB/VC/VBの材質・形状別)をまとめた表です。形番の一部を入力するだけで検索できます。</p> <p style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin-top: 8px;\">○ = NOK・三正・大光の3社規格すべてに共通 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ★ = NOK・三正に共通 &nbsp;·&nbsp; △ = 三正・大光に共通 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ⬠ = NOK・大光に共通</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">형태 참고용 개념도 (SWS 카탈로그 실측 도면·NOK 등 제조사 도면 아님) — 일반적인 오일씰(스프링·더스트 립 있는 형식) 단면</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 240\" width=\"340\" height=\"227\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"88\"> <line x1=\"108\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"152\"> </g> <line x1=\"128\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"> <text x=\"236\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#555\">축</text> 